    <node id="Brown Armchair">
      <data key="d0">Brown Armchair</data>
      <data key="d1">furniture</data>
      <data key="d2">"A piece of seating furniture characterized by its brown color"&lt;SEP&gt;"Upholstered seating with plush cushioning"&lt;SEP&gt;The Brown Armchair is a piece of seating furniture noted for its plush cushion and curved backrest, providing an inviting and comfortable seating option. It features upholstery with soft cushioning, enhancing its appeal as a cozy and stylish addition to any space.</data>
      <data key="d3">"Can be sat on";"N/A";"sit;lean;relax";rest"</data>
      <data key="d4">"N/A";"fixed position;not suitable for heavy use"</data>
      <data key="d5">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d6">"Left side of the image; near a spherical object, slightly away from the robotic arm"&lt;SEP&gt;"Left side of the image; near a spherical object, slightly away from the robotic arm"&lt;SEP&gt;"left-edge;foreground"</data>
      <data key="d7">A plush brown armchair with a curved backrest, positioned near a dark wall or curtain.&lt;SEP&gt;The Brown Armchair is a cozy and plush seating option, distinguished by its curved back and short legs. It is positioned near a dark-colored wall or curtain, which enhances its aesthetic appeal and complements the furnishings within the indoor room. The armchair is notably located at the left edge in the foreground, emphasizing its inviting presence in the space.&lt;SEP&gt;The brown armchair is located in the living room, providing additional seating along with the grey couch.</data>
