    <node id="Sofa">
      <data key="d0">Sofa</data>
      <data key="d1">furniture</data>
      <data key="d2">"Gray cushioned sofa that provides seating in the environment."&lt;SEP&gt;The entity, Sofa, is described as a small, brown piece of furniture that features a soft, cushioned seat, and is available in either fabric or leather materials. As a versatile item, the sofa is designed primarily for sitting and can comfortably accommodate two or more people. It is constructed with various styles and materials, emphasizing comfort through its upholstery, which includes padding and support. Sofas are commonly utilized as indoor seating furniture, offering a functional and aesthetic addition to living spaces.</data>
      <data key="d3">"Can be sat on;"Can be sat upon;"N/A";"can be sat upon;"provides seating area;"sit;interacted with items placed on it";lean;leaned against;observed;relax";rest;rest";supports multiple users";used to place objects on its surface."</data>
      <data key="d4">"N/A";"care should be taken to keep it clean and free from sharp objects that may cause damage.";"fixed position;"keep_clean;avoid sharp objects";not suitable for heavy use"</data>
      <data key="d5">"N/A"&lt;SEP&gt;The entity being described is a Sofa. The provided descriptions highlight a significant lack of specific information, as several entries are marked as "N/A". However, one notable aspect mentions a "static scene with a possibility of interaction inferred due to adjacent robotic arm." This indicates that while the Sofa is primarily considered static, there is an implied potential for interaction, likely influenced by the presence of the robotic arm nearby. Overall, the Sofa is characterized by its static nature, but the context suggests that interaction may be possible within its environment.</data>
      <data key="d6">"Located on the left side of the image."&lt;SEP&gt;"N/A"&lt;SEP&gt;The sofa is centrally located within the indoor space, positioned against a beige wall. It occupies the lower left quadrant of the area depicted, suggesting a presence that enhances the room's overall aesthetic. The seating area of the sofa is cluttered with various items, indicating a lived-in environment. Additionally, the sofa is described as being in the upper left corner of another visual context, and is associated with the action of placing a pear on it, highlighting its role in everyday activities within the interior setting. Adjacent to the sofa is a dark ball, which further contributes to the arrangement and decor of the room.</data>
      <data key="d7">The Sofa is a gray cushioned piece of furniture situated to the left of the Indoor Environment.&lt;SEP&gt;The Sofa is a versatile indoor piece of furniture designed to accommodate multiple people, characterized by its simple and straight-line design, which makes it suitable for various room settings. It serves as a comfortable place for individuals to relax and fulfills multiple functions within the space. Specifically, one description mentions a small, brown upholstered sofa located in the upper left corner of a scene, associated with a pear item, illustrating its practical use as both seating and a decorative element. However, other descriptions refer to the Sofa as being gray and cushioned, emphasizing its comfort. Overall, it can be characterized as a gray indoor seating option designed for two or more people, exemplifying a simple design with straight lines while enhancing the indoor environment. In summary, the Sofa is a small, upholstered piece of furniture relevant to indoor home arrangement and comfort, located in the lower left quadrant adjacent to a dark ball on the floor, contributing to the overall atmosphere of the space.</data>
