    <node id="Robotic Arm">
      <data key="d0">Robotic Arm</data>
      <data key="d1">object</data>
      <data key="d2">The Robotic Arm is an advanced mechanical device designed for manipulation and assistance in various environments, prominently featuring in domestic and industrial settings. It is characterized by a sophisticated blue, silver, and white color scheme, with glossy blue complemented by white and brown sections, and metallic gold joints. The arm's end effector is beige, equipped with an orange grip specifically designed for handling food-related items effectively. 

This robotic arm is large and segmented, with articulated sections that enable a wide range of movements, closely mimicking those of a human arm. This versatility allows it to grasp and manipulate a diverse array of objects, thereby streamlining various culinary processes. While its primary application lies within kitchens, the Robotic Arm is also utilized for other domestic tasks as well as in industrial applications, such as manufacturing and automation.

Overall, the Robotic Arm represents innovative engineering and enhances productivity and convenience across multiple sectors, significantly improving operational efficiency in both culinary and industrial applications.</data>
      <data key="d3">"Can be actuated to extend or manipulate objects";"Can be used for automation in cooking;"Can extend;"Can grasp;"Can interact with objects;"Can interact with objects on the countertop;"Can manipulate;"Can manipulate objects;"Can move;"Can perform actions such as lifting, moving, or manipulating objects";"Can pick up;"Can potentially grasp;"Can reach for;"Grasp;"Manipulate and hold objects.";"Manipulate objects;"N/A";"Reach out to interact with objects;"can assist in gripping;"can be positioned;"can extend;"can grasp;"can interact with objects;"can manipulate;"can manipulate or place objects on the table";"can move;"can reach;"can_be_positioned_for_grasping;"engage with objects;"extend;"grasp;"grasp";"grip;"gripping_objects;"interact;"lift;"manipulate;"manipulate objects;"manipulate";"move;"move objects";"moving objects, assisting tasks";"navigate;"pick up;"picking up items";"position;"position for grasping;"reach;"reaching;"use";assemble;assist in observations";assist in tasks";can assist in manipulating objects";can hold objects";can manipulate objects in its environment";can manipulate objects";can pick objects;can pick up;can place objects on the table";capable_of_rotational_and_pivoting_movements";grasp;grasp objects";grasp";grip;grip items;grip objects;gripping;hold objects using its gripper";hold objects";inspect or interact with objects nearby";interact with kitchen items";interact with nearby objects.";interact with objects.";interact";interacting with kitchen items";lift;manipulate;manipulate items on the countertop";manipulate items";manipulate items.";manipulate objects;manipulate objects";manipulate";manipulating";move;move objects";move";moved;navigate;observe;observe";perform actions;perform automated tasks";perform automated tasks.";perform tasks automatically";perform tasks";pick;pick up objects";pick";pick_items";pivot";place";position";potentially for tasks like food preparation.";reach;rotate</data>
      <data key="d4">"Depends on programmed functions;"Depends on the programming and power supply;"Limited by its programming;"Limited range of motion;"N/A";"Requires power source;"Requires power source and programming;"Requires power source and programming";"Requires programming and power supply to operate";"depends on the programming and power supply;"failure_due_to_recognition_issues;"inactive state";"may fail due to object recognition issues;"movement confined to a specific workspace";"movement confined to specific workspace";"must be accurately controlled;"must be accurately controlled to pick up the correct objects;"must be used in a controlled environment;"must_align_accurately_with_objects;"must_have_functional_gripping_mechanism;"requires_power_source;May be dangerous if malfunctioning";limited access caused by surrounding items";limited by the weight or shape of the items.";limited by weight or shape";limited_access";may be dangerous if malfunctioning";may be sensitive";may have limited range";may have restrictions on weight and types of items it can handle";may_fail_if_not_calibrated";may_fail_if_not_calibrated_correctly";may_have_limited_range";needs_functional_mechanisms";operational boundaries;physical environment's access";physical environment's access.";physical limits based on design";requires power source for operation"</data>
      <data key="d5">The Robotic Arm is currently placed on a countertop, which denotes its static and inactive state at this moment. Despite this inactive position, it possesses the capability for movement and interaction with nearby objects, such as a sofa. In previous attempts, the Robotic Arm endeavored to perform tasks like retrieving items from a sink; however, these efforts were largely unsuccessful, as it failed to effectively grasp the intended objects. While the Robotic Arm is ready for action, there is limited additional information regarding its functions or improvements beyond these observations.</data>
      <data key="d6">The Robotic Arm is an advanced kitchen appliance strategically positioned in the upper-right corner of a kitchen environment, specifically situated above a blue wooden countertop. This location allows the arm to extend downward at an angle toward the sink, which reflects its intended function of facilitating a variety of kitchen tasks. Currently, the robotic arm is in standby mode, prepared to assist with common kitchen items, thus reinforcing its role in aiding cooking activities.

Its notable placement distinguishes it from nearby furniture, such as a sofa, while also emphasizing its dedicated function within the living space. The arm is in close proximity to everyday kitchen items, including a stick of butter and an orange on a nearby TV stand, which further underscores its utility in food preparation. It is spatially aligned above the countertop, positioned midway between the floor and a wall with closed doors, showcasing thoughtful design aimed at enhancing efficiency and functionality in the kitchen.

Additionally, the Robotic Arm maintains an alignment with a black sphere to its right and is suspended above various objects like a pear, a wrench, and a hammer. Although not currently engaged with specific items in its environment, it is designed to enhance cooking activities and is ready for interaction as needed, reflecting its advanced capabilities as a modern kitchen appliance.</data>
      <data key="d7">The Robotic Arm is a sophisticated mechanical device designed to assist with various tasks, primarily in indoor living spaces such as kitchens. It is positioned prominently on the right side of a counter, anchored to a brown base, and strategically hovers over a chair-like object to effectively interact with items within its environment. This advanced apparatus features a striking blue color scheme accented with white, gray, and vibrant orange details, particularly noticeable in its cylindrical, claw-like gripper.

Mimicking the functionality of a human arm, the Robotic Arm is equipped with multiple articulated joints that enable a wide range of movement and manipulation. Its capabilities include grasping and retrieving objects, such as small yellow items resembling butter or oranges, from various surfaces like TV stands and overhead areas, including couches and tables. While it excels in kitchen-specific applications, it is versatile enough to perform diverse household tasks, making it a practical addition to modern living spaces.

The integration of advanced technology with functional design allows the Robotic Arm to significantly enhance everyday life by revolutionizing the execution of tasks in both culinary and domestic settings. Overall, it showcases its global positioning within the upper right area of its operating environment, emphasizing its role in streamlining household activities.</data>
      <data key="d8">chunk-95e542c3e2cf3b80c2a386b4d7fe9506&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-889f0246a6bd818f7dff068464553bcb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6fd8274a2d1232f9f77a0ea15e523e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50ed04d922981d0130e000af0033b0c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f3c1375b13ddcfdfc4d020fb76384d5d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff19d1455befb4bd03990a913dbb67f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71e0853d6b8fb8e9385e8f8c6c3342ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a43c0038cb33aa953ea92fe00f539c77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61d59281ea4939e6692ff1c48515ab5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83791e02fffc409681757eddcca76382&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfb3c6fa3796bc522208d109471ca985&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c154e4c7b8608db1a00c46457ff956f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05b12ac4b5e7ef4ee723211268193b96&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e3f723354016e94461cb895163bed9cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f47b87b4b95fbe187651b52c3814eca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f48f3a35cb5c6244f3f99abb6e97b4ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b703e57f7f312079f6c2ad3c93d259e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2807ce2efcc2d6149fd67737e5587c99&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91704b2974dfe887dc964702675320e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ac88e7624d72a183b4aa96fb7a5fd8cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d89b523e359142053ba13f77d063f7f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-894e51b179dc3786ecfcad07007e4b1b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb088bdb1e42101b1ffa67137cd54633&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-191e598f72ba5bb9098d142aa877c30b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ddc5f0966c1173fb9dc699dcc5a35590&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d518b76528dec9a818e598d9519f9420&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-842e2fbd96c01331a0e8b984f377b9eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91f43fc8a040da99c992aca0c6fa2b9e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b49dd2520a0dddbb4dcaa4dd60231f9b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f4b6af94a6822cfe2dcbf1cfd9ea301&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-282928eba937a43b10c0f939440401f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c3bd83c5c76549d80af5d2102523481&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b0b76960b97861a35c90e0b690109b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fcc62d13e4271cfab3b042fbaf82ff07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c97b6ebfa7e0b37e0577457d045a55bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd46b2147100e03f5fba63a01ed56378&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2663373a7c15d583525613b528aaf782&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-512c99ba00abd1351acdffc5f28ef60b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b46182a389517b81bcff5fb38132d3ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a33ad67667853c31418ab82889e1e1b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-babdc4e6440123cf0378b9adab2b9736&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7717aa9c0edd7bec036e22965a596b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a72608daa69553f2bd7580d72ef3f276&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77b7befda35befcb26d2d3f894305445&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7cbbce93afed3ffcb65148b3aaee30ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54db96677933eae2def56d385069570f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3110c2c46307410294a70a5f9d323898&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-679a0eca9dc0e5e9a48835d7ff7c466a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5685800c044512697f52ce20f3f8314&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ea86f0bfeefa7977bc448ade9f1a3f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9bf34c6a958b339208ad3a08c0ce1da5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4cf5eab71b78283df8e29f602b2b999&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0733565437d07f56a63f574865e32dc5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c373a33b7f40d867bb7889415b47e8ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c10aba4bbd02e73bbafcb2fd810f9998&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c651a0e3056654de410cee9100331af6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35391a4e2ebd59df5086423332d5d61c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-60fb21a68457f79734302d0fad6e5d13</data>
