    <node id="Strawberry">
      <data key="d0">Strawberry</data>
      <data key="d1">object</data>
      <data key="d2">"A bright red, round fruit with green leaves, known for its sweetness."&lt;SEP&gt;Strawberry is a small, soft, edible fruit that is widely recognized for its vibrant red color, smooth surface, and characteristic green leafy top. It has a spherical shape and typically features a delightful sweetness and refreshing flavor, making it a favorite in various culinary applications. Strawberries are commonly enjoyed fresh, incorporated into desserts, snacks, beverages, and salads, showcasing their versatility across many cuisines. Overall, strawberries are celebrated not only for their striking appearance and delectable taste but also for their broad usage in culinary presentations.</data>
