      <data key="d2">"A setting designed for cooking and food preparation activities."&lt;SEP&gt;The Kitchen Environment is a designated space specifically designed for food preparation and cooking. It serves as the central hub for culinary activities, equipped with various tools and appliances necessary for preparing and cooking food. This area includes the kitchen objects themselves, as well as the surrounding space where various kitchen tasks are performed. A typical feature of the Kitchen Environment is a functional sink, which often contains several items related to cooking and food preparation, such as an orange. Overall, the Kitchen Environment is integral to the cooking process, promoting efficient and effective food preparation.</data>
