      <data key="d2">"A metallic tool with a shiny surface and an adjustable mouth, used for gripping and turning various fasteners."&lt;SEP&gt;The wrench is a medium-sized tool made of metal, specifically designed to provide grip and leverage for turning objects such as nuts and bolts. This particular wrench is characterized as a silver metallic adjustable wrench with a movable jaw, allowing it to adapt to various sizes of nuts and bolts. Its open-ended design enables it to lie flat on surfaces, such as a countertop, making it convenient for use. Additionally, its head is angled, enhancing its functionality in tight or awkward spaces. Overall, the wrench is an essential tool for mechanical and construction tasks, offering both versatility and efficiency.&lt;SEP&gt;"A tool used for gripping and turning objects, typically nuts and bolts."</data>
