      <data key="d2">"A space designed for cooking and meal preparation."&lt;SEP&gt;The kitchen is a dedicated room or area equipped for preparing and cooking food, serving as a crucial domestic space within a home. It is specifically designed for food preparation, and this space plays an essential role in everyday life as the primary location for meal preparation. Typically, the kitchen contains various appliances and surfaces that facilitate culinary tasks, making it integral to the overall functionality of a household. Among its numerous objects and fixtures, sinks are common, further enhancing its utility for cooking and food-related activities.&lt;SEP&gt;"The kitchen is a category referring to a room or space where cooking and food preparation occur."</data>
