    <node id="Countertop">
      <data key="d0">Countertop</data>
      <data key="d1">object</data>
      <data key="d2">"A flat surface in the kitchen where objects can be placed."&lt;SEP&gt;"A flat surface used for various tasks, typically located in kitchens or workshops."&lt;SEP&gt;The countertop is a flat surface commonly found in kitchens, specifically designed for food preparation and storage. It serves as a horizontal workspace where individuals can prepare meals, organize kitchen items, and conduct various culinary activities. By providing a designated area for placing items and preparing food, the countertop plays a crucial role in kitchen design and functionality, making it an essential feature for effective meal preparation and organization.</data>
