      <data key="d4">"N/A";"should be kept clean to avoid contamination"</data>
      <data key="d5">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d6">The entity "Countertop" is primarily associated with the kitchen, underscoring its significance as a key feature in this area of a home. While other descriptions provided in the data are marked as "N/A," indicating no additional specific details or distinctions, it is affirmed that countertops are essential components of kitchen design and functionality.</data>
      <data key="d7">The Countertop is a work surface found in the kitchen, used for preparing food and placing items like the Orange Cup.&lt;SEP&gt;The Countertop serves as a surface for placing objects like the Robotic Arm, Green Pear, and Claw Hammer, indicating its role in the environment.&lt;SEP&gt;The countertop is a flat surface that plays a crucial role in the kitchen environment, serving as a workspace where various tools and food items are positioned for preparation and observation. It is typically located near other essential kitchen fixtures, such as the sink, which enhances its functionality. The countertop is not only a practical area for laying out ingredients and tools but also accommodates a variety of objects, including specific items like a pear, a hammer, a wrench, and even a robotic arm. This versatility underscores its importance as a central component in the kitchen, facilitating various culinary tasks and contributing to the overall efficiency of the cooking process.</data>
      <data key="d8">chunk-ddc5f0966c1173fb9dc699dcc5a35590&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f4b6af94a6822cfe2dcbf1cfd9ea301&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c3bd83c5c76549d80af5d2102523481&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-679a0eca9dc0e5e9a48835d7ff7c466a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9bf34c6a958b339208ad3a08c0ce1da5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2663373a7c15d583525613b528aaf782&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-894e51b179dc3786ecfcad07007e4b1b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfb3c6fa3796bc522208d109471ca985&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e3f723354016e94461cb895163bed9cd</data>
