    <node id="Embodied Agent">
      <data key="d0">Embodied Agent</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">"An agent in a robotic or virtual context that perceives its environment."&lt;SEP&gt;The Embodied Agent is a digital or robotic entity that possesses a physical presence, enabling it to observe and interact with its environment effectively. Characterized by its capability to execute tasks, the Embodied Agent excels in navigating spaces and engaging with its surroundings. It dynamically adapts to fulfill its designated functions, which encompass conducting observations and interactions that enhance its effectiveness as an agent within various environments. Overall, the Embodied Agent stands out for its proficiency in navigating and observing, allowing it to interact meaningfully with the world around it.&lt;SEP&gt;"N/A"</data>
