    <node id="embodied_agent">
      <data key="d0">embodied_agent</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">"N/A"&lt;SEP&gt;"N/A"&lt;SEP&gt;The embodied agent is a type of actor characterized by its ability to navigate and interact with a physical environment. This entity possesses a physical form that enables it to perform actions and respond to various stimuli within that environment.</data>
      <data key="d3">"N/A";"interact;"navigate;"navigate";perform tasks"</data>
      <data key="d4">"N/A";observe"</data>
      <data key="d5">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d6">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d7">The embodied agent is an actor in the task, responsible for navigating to the refrigerator and observing the environment.&lt;SEP&gt;The embodied agent is an entity that plays a crucial role in navigating and observing its surroundings. It is responsible for traversing various environments, such as a kitchen and tabletop scenes, with the objective of reaching specific locations, including a chair, cabinet 5, and a sofa. In each context, the embodied agent conducts observations of the respective contents it encounters, demonstrating its active presence in these settings. Its primary functions encompass both navigation and observation, allowing it to effectively interact with and analyze its environment. Overall, the embodied agent embodies a dual role in performing navigation within diverse contexts and conducting systematic observations of items and surroundings.&lt;SEP&gt;The embodied agent is the actor that navigates the kitchen environment and interacts with objects in the task of reaching the right drawer.</data>
      <data key="d8">chunk-c3bc1c91eadc47a11af404b983abb2d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbc9e5b1a99517c95fb6c76a1254a379&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-26187e3c991b49bfc7f789f4aafc93f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23745efea012edbe0cdbde575e6dd39e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-12916031e53dc924d9fcb0c41475bf10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-386546b08f03613bd02a1961790cf077&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e558aa1ffffc9e3ee9d5eba4ef6bacfe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42a8800fd5eb4780419dd640aa3c2edf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1058b785568123c9dd67809d1e3c64cc</data>
