      <data key="d0">perception_update</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">The entity "perception_update" refers to an event type that involves changes or observations in the environment. It is specifically associated with updates that are based on sensory observations made within that environment. This concept emphasizes the importance of both reported changes and the active observation process as key components of understanding and interpreting the surrounding world.</data>
