      <data key="d2">"A fruit that is typically green and spherical in shape."&lt;SEP&gt;The Green Pear is an edible fruit recognized for its green color and typical pear shape. It is characterized by a teardrop shape and features a sweet flavor complemented by smooth skin. Commonly used as food, the ripe green pear is a popular choice among fruit lovers for its pleasing taste and texture.&lt;SEP&gt;"Fruit, green color, smooth texture, typical pear shape."</data>
