      <data key="d7">The Green Pear is a small, spherical fruit known for its vibrant green color, located on a countertop.&lt;SEP&gt;The Green Pear is a type of fruit recognized for its sweet flavor and smooth skin, which typically features a characteristic pear shape that is wider at the base and tapers towards the top. In the context of a specific scene, the Green Pear is positioned near a hammer on a dark surface. It is situated closer to the viewer's perspective and towards the left side, making it an additional object of interest for a robotic arm interacting with the environment.&lt;SEP&gt;The Green Pear is a smooth-textured fruit with a typical pear shape, characterized by a bulbous lower section tapering towards the stem.</data>
