    <node id="Kitchen Area">
      <data key="d0">Kitchen Area</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">"Space designed for cooking and meal preparation, typically containing appliances, counters, and storage."&lt;SEP&gt;The Kitchen Area refers to a designated space within a home or building specifically allocated for cooking and meal preparation. It serves as a room where food is prepared and cooked, often featuring modern design elements that enhance its functionality and aesthetic appeal. This area is central to daily living, facilitating not only the preparation of meals but also serving as a gathering place for family and friends.</data>
