      <data key="d4">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d5">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d6">"N/A"&lt;SEP&gt;The Kitchen Area is situated in the background of the room, extending leftward from the main scene. This description emphasizes its positioning and relationship to the surrounding environment.</data>
      <data key="d7">The Kitchen Area is a designated part of the room that is specifically equipped for culinary activities. It includes various tools and appliances essential for cooking and food preparation. This area features a modern and minimalistic design, emphasizing functionality and a clean aesthetic. It is located in the background of the room and extends leftward from the main scene. The Kitchen Area's primary function is the housing of cooking items and furniture, making it a critical component of the overall living space.&lt;SEP&gt;The Kitchen Area refers to a defined space for culinary activities, equipped with essential tools and fixtures such as cabinets and countertops that facilitate cooking.</data>
      <data key="d8">chunk-f232128dcfc562d42de4f2fd77a63e5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bccc7a95bec699180dde3a3987d59e0b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53daedf4d04d6753bedcb7a46e631c8a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61d59281ea4939e6692ff1c48515ab5c</data>
