    <node id="Furniture">
      <data key="d0">Furniture</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">"Furniture refers to movable articles that support various human activities such as seating or sleeping."&lt;SEP&gt;Furniture consists of various items designed for supporting a range of human activities such as seating, eating, and storage. It is an essential category of movable objects aimed at enhancing the functionality and comfort of living spaces. These items play a critical role in daily life, as they are specifically tailored to meet the needs of individuals in their everyday environments. Overall, furniture is integral to creating comfortable and functional living spaces.</data>
      <data key="d3">"N/A";"arrange;"can be used for sitting;can be used for decorating";can be used for holding items;modify";use</data>
      <data key="d4">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d5">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d6">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d7">Furniture encompasses a diverse range of movable items, including tables, chairs, sofas, cabinets, rugs, and plants, that serve both functional and comfort-enhancing purposes within living spaces. These objects play a crucial role in various activities such as seating, eating, and daily tasks, thereby enriching the overall utility and aesthetic of indoor environments. In a living room setting, furniture contributes to creating a supportive and organized layout, featuring specific items like armchairs, a blue table, and a cabinet, alongside other essential pieces that may include various chairs and tables. Overall, furniture refers to a collection of objects designed for different functions, enhancing the usability and visual appeal of any living area.&lt;SEP&gt;Furniture in the Indoor Environment encompasses items like tables and sofas, contributing to both comfort and utility.</data>
      <data key="d8">chunk-ff19d1455befb4bd03990a913dbb67f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4cf5eab71b78283df8e29f602b2b999&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0733565437d07f56a63f574865e32dc5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd46b2147100e03f5fba63a01ed56378&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ecf2280bc7b5bd1b98c3a9bcdb00e426&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35391a4e2ebd59df5086423332d5d61c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b9e0b05991de9937fe35bfd38dcb802</data>
