    <node id="Living Room">
      <data key="d0">Living Room</data>
      <data key="d1">geo</data>
      <data key="d2">The Living Room is a central domestic space designed primarily for relaxation and social interaction. It serves as a gathering area where individuals can unwind and connect with family and friends. Typically furnished with a couch and various seating arrangements, the Living Room creates an inviting environment that fosters comfort and conversation. It is a common space in a home, integral to leisure activities and social gatherings. Additionally, it often contains specific furniture and appliances, further enhancing its functionality as a hub for both relaxation and socializing. Overall, the Living Room plays a crucial role in creating a warm atmosphere conducive to personal connections.</data>
      <data key="d3">"N/A";"Provide a space for social interaction;"can be used for watching TV;"sit;"sitting;can be used for sitting;can be used for socializing";furnish with furniture";relax";relaxation";social_interactions;socialize</data>
      <data key="d4">"N/A";"maintain_cleanliness;"must_maintain_cleanliness;not_a_workspace"</data>
      <data key="d5">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d6">The Living Room is described as a central area in a home, characterized by a cozy atmosphere and designed to facilitate relaxation and social interaction. This space typically contains various furniture pieces, including a central couch, which serves as the focal point of the room. To the left of the couch, there is an armchair positioned to enhance the seating arrangement and comfort. While additional details about the Living Room's layout or decor are not provided, the overall description emphasizes its role as a welcoming and comfortable space within the home.</data>
      <data key="d7">The Living Room is portrayed as a cozy, organized environment that serves as a common gathering space for family and friends. This inviting area features carefully arranged furniture, prominently including a grey couch and a brown armchair, complemented by a geometric patterned rug. A blue table adds to its charm, while specific details such as a plant and a cabinet enhance the room's aesthetics. The Living Room is designed for leisure and social interaction, evident through the inclusion of a TV stand and a television, which bolster its role as a space for relaxation and entertainment. Additionally, a pear is located in the Living Room, further indicating its function as a versatile domestic environment suitable for various activities, including a transfer task. Overall, the Living Room is depicted as a tidy and functional area, ideal for hosting guests and facilitating social gatherings.</data>
      <data key="d8">chunk-23745efea012edbe0cdbde575e6dd39e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0733565437d07f56a63f574865e32dc5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f141569c90d0dc3f466444b6898c4311&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e546630ed17f52ad48d0a1336f0a17eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35391a4e2ebd59df5086423332d5d61c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-607a9f53a0ca2b2b566875369dd490ec</data>
