    <node id="Kitchen Sink">
      <data key="d0">Kitchen Sink</data>
      <data key="d1">receptacle</data>
      <data key="d2">The Kitchen Sink is a functional fixture specifically designed for various kitchen activities, including cleaning and preparing food items. It typically features a rectangular basin, often gray or silver in color, that is embedded in the counter. The design of the kitchen sink allows it to hold water effectively, making it ideal for washing dishes and other food-related tasks.</data>
