      <data key="d2">"A cup that is colored orange, used for holding liquids."&lt;SEP&gt;"A small container used for drinking or holding liquids."&lt;SEP&gt;The Orange Cup is a small cup that is characterized by its vibrant orange color. It is typically used for drinking or holding liquids. This cup is designed not only for functionality but also adds a bright touch to any table setting, making it suitable for a variety of beverages.</data>
