    <node id="Spatula">
      <data key="d0">Spatula</data>
      <data key="d1">item</data>
      <data key="d2">"A kitchen utensil used for flipping, spreading, or lifting food items."&lt;SEP&gt;The spatula is a crucial culinary tool characterized by its flat, broad blade and long handle, making it essential for a variety of cooking tasks. This versatile kitchen utensil is primarily used for flipping, lifting, spreading, or serving food items. Its design typically features a slender handle angled towards the user and a flat scoop, which enhances the user experience, allowing for efficient handling of food during preparation and serving. Spatulas are often utilized in activities such as flipping pancakes, serving cake, and spreading ingredients. They are commonly made from materials like plastic, metal, or silicone, making them suitable for use by both professional chefs and home cooks. Overall, the spatula remains a fundamental instrument in any kitchen due to its practicality and ease of use.</data>
      <data key="d3">"Can be used for flipping;"Can be used to flip;"Can be used to flip items on a pan;"Can flip;"N/A";"Used to flip;"flip;"flip food;"flipping;"pick_up;flip;lift;lift items";or serve food.";scrape;scraping;serve;serve food;serve";serving food items";spread;spread food.";spread ingredients;spread ingredients";spread";stirring food";transfer food";turn</data>
      <data key="d4">"N/A";"Should be kept away from high heat to prevent melting or deformation (if made of plastic)";"keep_away_from_high_heat;"not suitable for very hot surfaces;"not_suitable_for_high_temperatures";"should be kept away from high heat to prevent melting or deformation (if made of plastic)";damaged_edges";not for high-temperature cooking environments"</data>
      <data key="d5">The Spatula is characterized by its indication of potential recent use, as suggested by the available data. Despite many specifics being noted as "N/A," which indicates a lack of further applicable information, the primary observation points to the spatula's recent activity. It is associated with a specific interaction event during which an attempt was made to use the spatula for a particular task; however, this attempt ultimately failed.</data>
      <data key="d6">"Initially believed to be on the right counter; not found during observation."&lt;SEP&gt;The spatula is located on the countertop in the kitchen, specifically positioned in the lower right corner of the image. It lies flat on the surface, with its handle oriented towards the viewer and the scoop resting against the countertop. The spatula is partially crossing over a strawberry, which is also situated nearby on the countertop. Although it is described as being prominently featured in the lower center of the image, the various observations indicate that it extends toward the bottom edge and is indeed positioned to the right of the strawberry. Initial assumptions suggested that the spatula was on the right counter, but this was corrected to clarify that it is on the countertop. Its functional design and strategic placement contribute to its significance in the overall composition of the image.&lt;SEP&gt;"currently located on the right counter and is to be moved to the right receptacle of the left counter."</data>
      <data key="d7">A spatula is a versatile kitchen utensil essential for various culinary tasks, such as flipping, spreading, and lifting food items. It is typically made from materials like plastic, metal, or silicone, designed to be flat and broad for effective handling of food. This specific black spatula has been documented lying flat diagonally on the kitchen countertop, positioned between a strawberry and a pat of butter, illustrating its frequent use in food preparation.

Initially located on the right edge of the countertop, the spatula's position has since shifted to rest partly visible at the lower center of the countertop. Its long handle and broad blade contribute to its efficiency and practicality in the kitchen. Notably, the spatula's design not only caters to manual cooking tasks but also suggests potential use with robotic arms, emphasizing its role in both traditional and automated culinary practices.

Furthermore, the spatula's durable construction is ideal for the kitchen setting, and there are plans for its relocation to the right receptacle of the left counter, indicating its importance in kitchen organization. Overall, the spatula exemplifies a vital presence in any kitchen environment, with attributes that make it indispensable for any cooking activities.&lt;SEP&gt;Initially located on the right counter, the spatula is characterized by a flat, broad blade and can be made from materials like plastic, wood, or metal.</data>
      <data key="d8">chunk-61e0642e7493eaadc2d0ef8540a842ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f48f3a35cb5c6244f3f99abb6e97b4ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a72608daa69553f2bd7580d72ef3f276&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2807ce2efcc2d6149fd67737e5587c99&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c3bd83c5c76549d80af5d2102523481&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b0b76960b97861a35c90e0b690109b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-282928eba937a43b10c0f939440401f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fcc62d13e4271cfab3b042fbaf82ff07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ac88e7624d72a183b4aa96fb7a5fd8cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83791e02fffc409681757eddcca76382&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19fb3cc3eec9e39e0a037a43b76be742&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2663373a7c15d583525613b528aaf782&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd7a3f830c9003a2fcb1b91e91ae47a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c154e4c7b8608db1a00c46457ff956f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d938391f0c5ac3146df4cf04a3a65025</data>
