    <node id="Action Sequence">
      <data key="d0">Action Sequence</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">An Action Sequence is defined as a series of actions carried out by an embodied agent during a task. It encompasses a sequence of executed tasks or movements and consists of the steps taken to complete a specific task. In particular, when focused on a kitchen setting, an Action Sequence refers to a series of defined actions performed by the embodied agent in that context.</data>
