    <node id="Refrigerator">
      <data key="d0">Refrigerator</data>
      <data key="d1">object</data>
      <data key="d2">The refrigerator is a kitchen appliance specifically designed for storing food and beverages at low temperatures. This household appliance plays a crucial role in maintaining cool temperatures that help preserve the freshness and longevity of food items. It features a closed door structure, ensuring that the internal environment remains consistent and cool, which is vital for food safety and quality. Refrigerators are considered standard fixtures in most kitchens, serving as essential tools for food storage.</data>
      <data key="d3">"N/A";"Store food and drinks;"navigate;"open;access";close;keep items fresh;observe;open/close its door";open/close its door.";preserve";store;store"</data>
      <data key="d4">"Must be closed to maintain proper cooling;"N/A";"obstructed_access";some items may spoil if left out";some items may spoil if left out."</data>
      <data key="d5">"N/A"&lt;SEP&gt;The entity in focus is the refrigerator. One notable aspect of the refrigerator is the need to close its door if left open, as this is essential for maintaining its efficiency and ensuring food safety. No additional information is provided in the descriptions.</data>
      <data key="d6">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d7">A refrigerator is a vital kitchen appliance designed to maintain a cool environment for food storage, primarily used for storing food and beverages at low temperatures. It typically features a motorized cooling system and shelves for organization, allowing users to easily access and retrieve contents. The appliance plays a crucial role in the kitchen environment, facilitating navigation and organization. Its door provides access to the interior, highlighting its importance as a central location for food storage. Additionally, the refrigerator is noted as a key object in the home, further emphasizing its significance in daily living tasks, such as needing to be opened or closed for use.</data>
      <data key="d8">chunk-04283076125108b1003b3957a7716a63&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f4c84367056eb7ea93f9e283bfd049a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0733565437d07f56a63f574865e32dc5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31e979835f2804ff8d1ce116dbce00c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f141569c90d0dc3f466444b6898c4311&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6a9da891ede12376a00cfbf3a48e356</data>
      <data key="d9">unknown_source</data>
