      <data key="d6">"Center of the image"&lt;SEP&gt;"Center of the image."</data>
      <data key="d7">The Refrigerator Interior Surface features a textured design with vertical grooves or ridges that serve both aesthetic and functional purposes, such as holding shelving units or guiding airflow. The color typically is muted, like off-white or light grey, to maintain a clean appearance.&lt;SEP&gt;The refrigerator interior surface typically features a textured design with vertical grooves or ridges, serving both aesthetic and functional purposes such as holding shelving units or guiding airflow. The color is usually muted, like off-white or light grey, to maintain a clean appearance.</data>
