    <node id="Orange">
      <data key="d0">Orange</data>
      <data key="d1">item</data>
      <data key="d2">"A citrus fruit typically round and orange in color."&lt;SEP&gt;"A small object with a bright hue, typically considered a fruit."&lt;SEP&gt;The entity "Orange" refers to a fruit that is typically round in shape and belongs to the citrus family. This small, round citrus fruit is characterized by its bright orange exterior, which is commonly recognized for its vibrant color. The orange is well-known for its sweet and tangy flavor, making it a popular choice for consumption. It is often utilized in various culinary applications, further solidifying its status as a staple in many diets.</data>
      <data key="d3">"Can be picked;"be picked up;"can be eaten;"can be picked up;"eat;"may be picked up;"picked_up;be washed";can be juiced;can be moved;can be placed in different locations";eaten;flavoring";is edible";juice;juiced;juiced.";moved;placed";used as a flavoring"</data>
      <data key="d4">"N/A";"accessible_only_if_not_obstructed";"can be difficult to access if obstructed by other items"</data>
      <data key="d5">"Not visible at the time of the task execution."&lt;SEP&gt;"initial_attempts_occurred_before_success"&lt;SEP&gt;The orange was initially found on a TV stand in a living room and was later relocated to a sink. There are no additional details available regarding its characteristics or observations during the task execution, as some information was marked as "N/A" and the orange was not visible at certain times.</data>
      <data key="d6">"N/A"&lt;SEP&gt;The entity named Orange was initially situated in a challenging position within the sink, obstructed by other items, which complicated the ability of a robotic arm to pick it up. Subsequently, it was on a TV stand in the living room before being placed on a red plate inside the sink.</data>
      <data key="d7">Description not available in text.&lt;SEP&gt;The Orange is a citrus fruit distinguished by its small, round shape and vibrant bright orange skin. It is well-known for its sweet, tangy flavor and is often enjoyed as juice. In a particular scenario, the Orange is located in a kitchen sink, where it has been successfully moved from a TV stand. In this setting, the Orange becomes the focal point of a robotic arm's manipulation attempt, although the arm encounters difficulties due to surrounding objects obstructing its movement. Overall, the Orange stands out not only for its appealing characteristics but also as a subject of interaction in a kitchen environment.&lt;SEP&gt;The orange is described as a small object with a bright hue, located on a TV stand. It can be picked up and moved, and there were initial attempts to pick up incorrect objects, such as an apple and a can, before successfully retrieving the orange.</data>
      <data key="d8">chunk-95e542c3e2cf3b80c2a386b4d7fe9506&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-889f0246a6bd818f7dff068464553bcb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca4bc8bccdf736abb2732024b3d6b6b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e485bfc38ba09c826cac7eb26b98b87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35391a4e2ebd59df5086423332d5d61c</data>
