    <node id="TV Stand">
      <data key="d0">TV Stand</data>
      <data key="d1">furniture</data>
      <data key="d2">"A rectangular piece of furniture designed to hold a TV and provide storage."&lt;SEP&gt;A TV stand is a piece of furniture specifically designed to hold a television and support related components. It typically features storage capacity, allowing for the organization of accessories, devices, and other media items. The design of a TV stand ensures that it effectively combines functionality with a practical storage solution, making it an essential item for home entertainment setups.</data>
