      <data key="d6">"center of the scene, against the wall"&lt;SEP&gt;"foreground of the living room setting, positioned in front of a large flat-screen television"</data>
      <data key="d7">The TV stand is a rectangular piece of furniture painted in deep blue, featuring two glass-doored cabinets adorned with grid-like patterns. It is designed to support a flat-screen TV, which is mounted above it in a living room setting. The stand is elevated on short legs and serves as a base for various objects, including an orange. This multifunctional furniture not only enhances the aesthetic of the indoor space but also provides storage for devices, making it a practical addition to home decor.&lt;SEP&gt;The TV stand is a rectangular structure painted in deep blue, featuring glass-fronted cabinets and designed to hold a flat-screen TV mounted on the wall above it. It is slightly elevated by short legs.</data>
