      <data key="d2">A couch is a piece of furniture commonly used for seating, often located in living rooms and other living spaces. It is typically designed to accommodate multiple people and is usually upholstered for comfort. The descriptions highlight that a couch serves as a comfortable seating option, with an emphasis on its design and function in a home environment.</data>
