    <node id="Plant">
      <data key="d0">Plant</data>
      <data key="d1">object</data>
      <data key="d2">A plant is a living organism typically characterized by its green color, growth, leaves, stems, and roots. It belongs to the plant kingdom and often requires light and water for development. Plants are commonly used for decorative purposes, such as being kept in homes or offices, and they play a significant role in improving air quality. They possess the ability to photosynthesize, a crucial process for their energy production and sustenance. An example of a decorative plant would be one with green leaves placed in a white pot, serving both aesthetic and environmental functions.</data>
      <data key="d3">"Decorative;"Decorative use;"N/A";"Provide oxygen;"grow;decorate;decorate";enhance decoration";improve indoor air quality";improve_air_quality;improves aesthetics of the space.";purify"</data>
      <data key="d4">"N/A";"Require water and sunlight;may need repotting"</data>
      <data key="d5">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d6">The entity is a plant that is positioned in the mid-ground, next to the top of the stairs, and is displayed on a square stand. There are no additional details provided about the plant's specific characteristics or type.</data>
      <data key="d7">The Plant serves multiple purposes within the Modern Indoor Room, enhancing both the aesthetic and functionality of the space. Positioned next to the top of the stairs on a square stand, it serves as a decorative element, contributing significantly to the overall aesthetics of the living room. Situated between red and beige walls, the plant not only adds a natural touch to the decor but also helps improve air quality, positively influencing the indoor atmosphere. Its placement in the background of the living area further enriches the aesthetic appeal, allowing it to fulfill both decorative and functional roles within the environment. Overall, the Plant enhances the decorative qualities of the room while also promoting a healthier indoor space.</data>
      <data key="d8">chunk-f48f3a35cb5c6244f3f99abb6e97b4ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f232128dcfc562d42de4f2fd77a63e5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff19d1455befb4bd03990a913dbb67f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0733565437d07f56a63f574865e32dc5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f141569c90d0dc3f466444b6898c4311&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c97b6ebfa7e0b37e0577457d045a55bc</data>
      <data key="d9">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d10">1772631077</data>
    </node>
