    <node id="Living Space">
      <data key="d0">Living Space</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">"A room designed for relaxation and daily activities, equipped with furniture and appliances."&lt;SEP&gt;Living Space refers to a room designed for living, which encompasses various elements essential for comfort and functionality. It contains furniture and decorative elements, creating an inviting atmosphere. This area is specifically tailored for relaxation and daily activities, equipped with both furniture and appliances to enhance usability. Furthermore, it serves as a designated area within a building for family activities and leisure, making it a central part of home life.&lt;SEP&gt;"Living Space defines an area used for domestic activities and relaxation."</data>
      <data key="d3">"N/A";"living;"socialize;integrate technology";integrating technology";socializing</data>
      <data key="d4">"N/A";"layout may limit movement or positioning"</data>
      <data key="d5">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d6">The Living Space features a centralized layout designed for optimal functionality and ease of movement. It includes essential furniture such as a sofa, table, and a bicycle, all strategically arranged to create a practical environment. The space's global position is established at the center of the scene, with local relations highlighting the significance of surrounding elements. Specifically, there are two counters: a right counter, which is prominent in the foreground and includes a robotic arm, and a left counter that is also visible. Overall, the arrangement and design of the Living Space emphasize both comfort and utility.</data>
      <data key="d7">Living Space is a broader concept that describes the combined areas (like the Indoor Environment) where people reside and conduct daily activities.&lt;SEP&gt;The Living Space is a modern indoor area designed to encompass versatility for various activities, featuring contemporary furniture and elements that support relaxation, work, and exercise. This domestic environment is equipped with items that facilitate everyday living and offers the potential for automation. Notably, it includes functional elements such as an orange and a TV stand, which contribute to family activities within the space. Overall, the Living Space serves as a multifunctional area that enhances the quality of life through its thoughtfully arranged components.&lt;SEP&gt;The living space is a domestic environment designed for everyday living, featuring various functional and decorative elements, including furniture and potential for automation.</data>
      <data key="d8">chunk-ff19d1455befb4bd03990a913dbb67f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e485bfc38ba09c826cac7eb26b98b87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd46b2147100e03f5fba63a01ed56378&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c154e4c7b8608db1a00c46457ff956f3</data>
      <data key="d9">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d10">1772631493</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Exercise Ball">
      <data key="d0">Exercise Ball</data>
      <data key="d1">object</data>
      <data key="d2">"A large inflatable sphere used for physical exercise and rehabilitation."&lt;SEP&gt;"A large inflatable sphere used for physical exercise and rehabilitation."&lt;SEP&gt;"An inflatable ball used in physical fitness activities to improve balance and core strength."&lt;</data>
      <data key="d3">"sit;"stability training;"used for various exercises such as stability training and stretching";balance";exercise;stretching"</data>
      <data key="d4">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d5">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d6">"Global position: Left side of the scene; Local relations: Next to a dark table, part of a multifunctional area."&lt;SEP&gt;"left side of the scene; next to a dark table, indicating its role in a multifunctional area"</data>
      <data key="d7">The Exercise Ball is a large tool used for exercise, situated in the living space, indicating its multifunctionality.&lt;SEP&gt;The exercise ball, located in the center area of the indoor living space, is used for various workout routines and exercises.&lt;SEP&gt;The Exercise Ball is large and gray, located in the living space, indicating its use for fitness activities.</data>
      <data key="d8">chunk-fd46b2147100e03f5fba63a01ed56378&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f48f3a35cb5c6244f3f99abb6e97b4ac</data>
