    <node id="Bicycle">
      <data key="d0">Bicycle</data>
      <data key="d1">object</data>
      <data key="d2">A bicycle is a human-powered vehicle characterized by two wheels, which can be utilized for transportation, exercise, or recreation. Typically situated within an environment, it may be found near windowed doors, highlighting its accessibility and integration into daily life.</data>
