      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">"A room characterized by a mix of living space and practical utilities, featuring various objects and furniture."&lt;SEP&gt;The Indoor Environment refers to a defined space where various objects are arranged and utilized, typically designed for human activity. This space can be characterized as a room that blends living space with practical utilities, and it is enclosed, featuring multiple furniture pieces and items that facilitate everyday activities. Overall, the Indoor Environment is a crafted area that supports various functions through its arrangement and presence of furniture.</data>
