      <data key="d6">"Center of the image shows a wooden table; sofa is on the left; bicycle is far left near windowed doors; robotic arm is on the right counter. "&lt;SEP&gt;"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d7">The Indoor Environment is a multifaceted concept that encompasses spaces where individuals live or work, featuring a variety of items and furniture that enhance both aesthetic appeal and functionality. It typically includes essential objects like furniture, decor, and mechanical components. Specifically, one described Indoor Environment features a wooden table situated at the center, a sofa positioned on the left side, and a bicycle placed near windowed doors, along with a robotic arm located on the right counter. Moreover, the Indoor Environment often incorporates kitchen utensils and furniture arranged to facilitate practical use, further contributing to its overall utility and design.&lt;SEP&gt;The Indoor Environment is a space that includes a variety of objects such as furniture and decor, designed for both leisure and utility activities.</data>
      <data key="d8">chunk-ff19d1455befb4bd03990a913dbb67f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ac88e7624d72a183b4aa96fb7a5fd8cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-12f8717b377b7c2a7ebfe09e99c2a221&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f3c1375b13ddcfdfc4d020fb76384d5d</data>
