      <data key="d12">The Robotic Arm is a crucial device designed for interaction with items situated on the Kitchen Counter, playing an essential role in automating various tasks related to cooking and food preparation. Positioned above the counter, the Robotic Arm efficiently extends downwards to engage with the items placed on the surface, which underscores its functional purpose within the kitchen environment. Throughout the descriptions, it is consistently noted that the arm hovers or is strategically situated above the countertop, emphasizing its relevance and operational capability in the workspace. Overall, the Robotic Arm is designed to enhance efficiency in the kitchen by performing mechanical tasks in conjunction with the Kitchen Counter.&lt;SEP&gt;The robotic arm is positioned on the kitchen counter, indicating its use in automated cooking tasks.</data>
